    "description": "<p>You come from road clans, convoy families, or people who survived by never staying owned. You know engines, routes, and the value of family chosen at road.</p><h4>LIFE PATH FEATURES</h4><p><em><strong>Road Sprint:</strong></em> When you succeed on an Agility Roll or vehicle roll to move from Far or Very Far range into Melee range with one or more targets, you can mark a Stress to deal 1d12 physical damage to all targets within Melee range.</p><p><em><strong>Off-Road Born:</strong></em> You can move naturally through rubble, broken roads, mud, sand, shallow water, wreckage, and unstable ground.</p>",
